4 2) Whether the prosecution proves beyond reasonable doubt that on 10.10.2013 accused Nos.4 to 6 being police officials within the limits of Hulimavu police station having learnt the information that accused Nos.1 to 3 are in the habit of joining themselves as maid servants in a house and commit theft by administering sleeping pills or stupefying substance, without bringing the same to their higher officials and also without wearing their uniform went in a Maruti Omni car to the house of accused No.1 situated at Anekal as well as to the house of accused Nos.2 and 3 situated at Marathahalli, projected themselves as police officials illegally extorted the stolen articles from them and thereby defrauded them which is punishable u/s 420 of IPC?
3) Whether the prosecution proves beyond reasonable doubt that, on the aforesaid date, time and place, under the aforesaid circumstances, accused Nos.4 to 6 in furtherance of common intention when accused Nos.1 to 3 were committing theft by joining as maid servants in the houses and were involved in committing theft of gold valuables by administering the sleeping pills on the house owners, accused Nos.4 to 6 having learnt the same without informing their higher officials and without wearing their uniforms approached accused No.1 in Anekal and accused Nos.2 and 3 at Marathahalli in their Maruti Omni car, recovered the articles and knowingfully well that the said articles were stolen from the house of CW.1 and possessed the same with them illegally and thereby committed an offence punishable u/s 411 r/w Sec. 34 of IPC?
4) Whether the prosecution proves beyond reasonable doubt that, on the aforesaid date, time and place under the aforesaid circumstances, accused Nos.4 to 6 in furtherance of common intention having learnt about the fact of theft committed by accused Nos.1 to 3 without taking any action against the accused No.1 and also without informing their higher officials approached accused Nos.1 to 3 in Anekal as well as in Marathahalli in their Maruti Omni car, forcibly taken the stolen articles into their possession despite knowing the fact that the said articles are required for the purpose of investigation without seizing them legally and destroyed the evidence having the gold chain dissolved in the gold jewel shops with an intention of screening the offence and thereby committed an offence punishable u/s 201 r/w Sec. 34 of IPC?
5) What Order ?
